{"id":"n49925-2-9","stage":3,"title":"막 · 乱","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49925-2-9-1","ko":"종이를 그렇게 막 버리면 어떡해?","zh":"就这么随便扔纸，怎么行呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"종이를","meaning":"纸，纸片","explanation":"종이：纸，纸片；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"종이","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75802","senseId":"1","lemma":"종이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"막","meaning":"乱，胡乱","explanation":"막：乱，胡乱","readings":[{"term":"막","audio":"/audio/29dcf5abee27c48e0743.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49925","senseId":"2","lemma":"막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버리면","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떡해?","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8879faff5daebd51","term":"종이","zh":"纸，纸片","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3","entryId":"75802","definition":"以木材为原料制成薄片，用于写字、绘画、印刷等诸多方面的东西。","pronunciation":["종이"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"29dcf5abee27c48e","term":"막","zh":"乱，胡乱","audio":"/audio/29dcf5abee27c48e0743.mp3","entryId":"49925","definition":"随随便便地。","pronunciation":["막"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"扔，丢","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"65570","definition":"丢弃或倒掉没必要继续持有的东西。","pronunciation":["버리다"]},{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/b6312cc4a03d61b1c6f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49925-2-9-2","ko":"어차피 종이도 많은데 뭘.","zh":"反正纸也多得很，没关系啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어차피","meaning":"反正，总归","explanation":"어차피：反正，总归","readings":[{"term":"어차피","audio":"/audio/fa2bed733cde8a67993d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67132","senseId":"1","lemma":"어차피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종이도","meaning":"纸，纸片","explanation":"종이：纸，纸片；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"종이","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75802","senseId":"1","lemma":"종이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은데","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘.","meaning":"没什么，哪里","explanation":"뭘：没什么，哪里","readings":[{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67413","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fa2bed733cde8a67","term":"어차피","zh":"反正，总归","audio":"/audio/fa2bed733cde8a67993d.mp3","entryId":"67132","definition":"不管怎样；或不管怎样做。","pronunciation":["어차피"]},{"id":"8879faff5daebd51","term":"종이","zh":"纸，纸片","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3","entryId":"75802","definition":"以木材为原料制成薄片，用于写字、绘画、印刷等诸多方面的东西。","pronunciation":["종이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"441ab920d2baa0d1","term":"뭘","zh":"没什么，哪里","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3","entryId":"67413","definition":"对对方的称赞或感谢表示谦让。","pronunciation":["뭘"]}],"audio":"/audio/b62af910875008855231.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.871,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49925","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5244,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就这么随便扔纸，怎么行呢？","反正纸也多得很，没关系啦。","前后辈之间的关系看起来真好。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就这么随便扔纸，怎么行呢？","反正纸也多得很，没关系啦。","前后辈之间的关系看起来真好。"],"answer":1}]}
